{'symbol': 'ABT', 'date': '2023-02-09 19:31:00', 'title': 'SHAREHOLDER ALERT: WEISS LAW INVESTIGATES CARDIOVASCULAR SYSTEMS, INC.', 'text': 'NEW YORK , FEB. 9, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0WEISS LAW\xa0IS INVESTIGATING POSSIBLE BREACHES OF FIDUCIARY DUTY AND OTHER VIOLATIONS OF LAW BY THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF CARDIOVASCULAR SYSTEMS, INC. ("CARDIOVASCULAR SYSTEMS" OR THE "COMPANY") (NASDAQ: CSII), IN CONNECTION WITH THE PROPOSED ACQUISITION OF THE COMPANY BY ABBOTT LABORATORIES (NYSE: ABT). UNDER THE TERMS OF THE MERGER AGREEMENT, THE COMPANY\'S SHAREHOLDERS WILL RECEIVE $20.00 IN CASH FOR EACH SHARE OF CARDIOVASCULAR SYSTEMS OWNED.'}